<div class="text guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">
<div class="markup-toc-wrapper">
<button class="markup-toc-button">Show Table of Contents</button></div>Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear List for Frost Death Knight DPS in Cataclysm Classic Phase 4. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Twilight Protocol Dungeons and Valor Points. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">
<span class="c6">Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear for Frost Death Knight DPS in Phase 4</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">
<span class="c6">Valor Points for Frost Death Knight DPS Phase 4</span></h3>Valor Points are the new main currency, that can be obtained with a weekly cap of 1600 from doing raids and Heroic dungeons. You spend this on your tier pieces, as well as various off-piece items and trinkets. When using this currency, you should consider your personal goals as well as those of your guild. There is not really a single solution that is optimal for every player. As thus, you should make your own assessment and not follow this list blindly. With the new raid tier releasing, all of our Valor will be converted to Justice Points, as there are new items introduced to the vendor.<br/>
<br/>
