<br/>
<br/>
<b>IMPORTANT:</b> The suggested items below are ranked with one option presented as the best, while others are simply "optional". Due to reforging, it is near impossible to rank several optional pieces. Simply put, what is best for you in a sub-optimal gear set might be worse for someone else, as reforging affects this massively. The embedded gear set above has reforges included, but they are seen in the context of you having every item available to you. If you are missing crucial pieces, you likely have to reforge your wait out of potential hit issues.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="body-armor">
<span class="c6">Body Armor for Frost Death Knight DPS</span></h3>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="head-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Head for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>Out of the items available to us pre-raid, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77155/visage-of-petrification">
<img alt="Visage of Petrification" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Visage of Petrification</span></a> is the best option for our helm. Note that it might be troublesome to gear around when stepping into raids, where you will want to use a different off-piece. Therefore, you should try to eventually pick up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77155/visage-of-petrification">
<img alt="Visage of Petrification" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Visage of Petrification</span></a> as well.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62368/arcanum-of-the-dragonmaw">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Dragonmaw" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Dragonmaw</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span>
<a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1172/dragonmaw-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragonmaw Clan</span></a> /<wbr/> <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62422/arcanum-of-the-wildhammer">
<img alt="Arcanum of the Wildhammer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of the Wildhammer</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>
<a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/faction=1174/wildhammer-clan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Wildhammer Clan</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
