<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Back for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>Things are really easy here, as our best option comes from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a>. There are no close alternatives and it should be your highest priority to get this item. You can look into the other items if you need to boost your item level to get into Heroics. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71269/mantle-of-fury">
