<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Wrist for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>The wrist slot is easy, as we have multiple great options. However <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77317/heartcrusher-wristplates">
<img alt="Heartcrusher Wristplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heartcrusher Wristplates</span></a> are the best. <br/>Note that they are BoE and can therefore be sent from another character or bought from another player on the Auction House. It is not worth the time looking into other options before stepping into raids.<div class="pad"></div>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=96261/enchant-bracer-major-strength">
