<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Legs for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>Yet another tier item with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78802/necrotic-boneplate-greaves">
