<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Rings for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>Our highest item level ring options are mostly interchangable, so it does not matter much which you end up grabbing. If you are capped on Valor from prioritizing other items, go for both rings from <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=3281/obsidian-fragment">
<span>
<img alt="Obsidian Fragment" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_stone_15.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Obsidian Fragment</span></span></a>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74215/enchant-ring-strength">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Strength</span></a> -  Only Enchanters may apply Ring Enchants on their own rings.<div class="pad"></div>
