<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">
<span class="c6">Weapons for Frost Death Knight DPS</span></h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-frost-death-knight-dps">Main-Hand Weapons for Frost Death Knight DPS</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78488/souldrinker">
<img alt="Souldrinker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Souldrinker</span></a> is really the only relevant item to consider. It is both available from the vendor and the last boss of Shadowfang Keep on Twilight difficulty. Note that you could buy <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71362/obsidium-cleaver">
